> - 操作类：射线延伸(ray_extend/ray_cast), 擦除(erase), 补全(complete), 堆叠(stacking), 平移对齐(translate_and_align), 推移(push), 平移(shift), 重涂色(recolor), 拼接(concatenate), 填充(fill), 周期扩展(periodic_expand), 中心重建(center_reconstruct), 透明叠加(transparent_overlay), 局部翻转(local_reverse), 裁剪(crop), 外框绘制(frame_draw), 镜像(reflect)
> - 对象类：实心矩形(solid_rectangle), 孤立标记(isolated_marker), 端帽(cap), 标记像素(marker_pixel), 固定标记(fixed_marker), 前景对象(foreground_object), 网格边界(grid_boundary), 重复瓦片(repeating_tile), 占位符区域(placeholder_region), 调色板列(palette_column), 目标列段(target_column_run), 对角副本(diag_copy), 分隔行(separator_row), 连通分量(connected_component), 封闭区域(enclosed_region), 块阵列(block_array), 空心中心(hollow_center), 前景像素(foreground_pixel), 孤立像素(isolated_pixel), 面板(panel), 分隔线(divider_line), 画布边界(canvas_boundary), 象限掩码(quadrant_mask), 中心分隔像素(center_separator), 像素段(pixel_segment), 空心矩形(hollow_rect), 多色目标对象(multicolor_target), 微型图例(micro_legend), 正方形(square), 外框(outer_frame), 间隙带(gap_strip)
> - 空间关系类：同色对应(same_color_match), 轴线对齐(axis_aligned), 包围盒(bounding_box), 对角链排列(diagonal_chain_layout), 角点重叠(corner_overlap), 接触侧决定方向(contact_side_dir), 周期延拓(periodic_extension), 顺序一一对应(order_correspondence), 对角排布(diag_layout), 内部包含(interior_containment), 对称映射(opposite_slot_mapping), 双色互换(two_color_swap), 尺寸分类(size_classification), 位置对齐(positional_alignment), 朝向与背离(toward_and_away), 层叠顺序(layer_stack), 中心对称(center_symmetry), 内部区域(interior_region), 颜色替换映射(color_sub_map), 尺寸倍增嵌套(size_doubled_nesting), 投射到最近边界(projection_to_nearest_edge), 跨轴对称(cross_axis_symmetry)
> - 条件/判断类：按左边缘排序(ordered_by_left_edge), 冲突优先级(conflict_priority), 推至边界停止(stop_at_boundary), 补全后平移(shift_after_completion), 按列段分组匹配(column_run_group_match), 空行填分隔色(blank_row_separator), 含空洞对象重涂(objects_with_holes_recolored), 边界像素编码(border_pixel_encoding), 仅交换两色(swap_two_colors_only), 单像素分量重涂(single_pixel_component_recolored), 双面板背景交集(both_panels_background_intersection), 颜色决定射线方向(color_determines_ray_direction), 四象限折叠同画布(quadrants_fold_one), 各侧独立翻转(independent_side_reverse), 标记框内保护(marker_bbox_protect), 图例色替换(legend_color_replace), 基底投射至边界(base_projects_to_edge), 最近边界方向(nearest_boundary_direction), 分隔色填充间隙(sep_color_fills_gap), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 三点定矩形框(three_pts_define_rect)
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

